You'd better switch to SRM.
ARC was meant to boot Windows (yes you can install Win NT 4.0 or 2000 beta
on it).
Switch to SRM by ARC menu named "Switch to Unix console" (something like
this). To go back from SRM to ARC just type 'arc' at the '>>>' prompt of
SRM.
to boot the floppy from the SRM type '>>> boot dva0' and go on with
installation.

